What?

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.180
But you already have a rod on you...

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.010
I meant a rod with a strand.

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:22.930
A strand of precum?
That's kinda random...

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:25.140
Knock it off already!

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:32.070
Ousai Academy Student Council Rules:

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.650
