00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:03.430
"Students are forbidden from getting into relationships."

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.260
"No normies allowed."

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:06.930
Forget breaking it down, you pulverized it!

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:08.270
