00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:20.500
And have a snowball fight before it all melts!

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.460
I take that back. I don't get it.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:31.470
All right. Let's shovel all this snow before the closing ceremony.

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:33.470
This is gonna be a pain.

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:35.350
Tsuda, my boy.

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:37.470
Who are we?

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:38.600
The student council.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:40.560
Exactly.

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:43.940
Our job is to open up a path for the students to follow!

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:48.270
If it embarrasses you,
don't say it in the first place.

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:50.820
I'm only red because of the cold!

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:52.240
Good.

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:53.910
You're all here.

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:56.410
Let's hurry up and get this over with.

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:58.580
What are you sounding like a teacher for?

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:00.080
I <i>am</i> a teacher.

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:06.710
It's so cold.

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:08.960
When it's this chilly...

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.840
it makes you wanna pee.
it makes you want to drink something hot.

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:13.010
We can help each other, then.

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:14.720
Hell no.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:19.600
It's slippery out here. You should be careful.

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:22.430
It's freezing...

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:24.640
inside my butt.

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:26.230
I must've misheard that.

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:31.480
Messing with the snow brings back memories of the times I spent making snowmen.

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:33.530
It reminds me of snowball fights.

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:35.240
And playing with sleds, too.

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:38.070
I remember making snow cones.

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:39.780
Oh, I did that too.

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:42.870
And peeing on them to make them
look lemon-flavored.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:44.620
I have no such memories.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:46.250
Oh yeah,

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:48.080
winter break starts tomorrow.

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:50.750
I can go home for the first time in ages.

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:54.090
Living alone can get pretty scary, so it's a huge relief.

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:57.840
So even you have things you're afraid of.

00:16:57.840 --> 00:16:59.140
That's a surprise.

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:00.010
Of course I do.

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:02.560
Nighttime is especially scary.

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:07.150
A real uneasiness starts to set in as
I wonder if I'm gonna be alone again this year.

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:09.020
I don't know what to say.

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:11.230
This should do it.

00:17:11.230 --> 00:17:12.900
It's nice and tidy now.

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:16.070
Another year's finished already.

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:18.660
A whole year. That was quick.

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:22.240
I get the feeling we say this every year.

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:24.540
Yeah, we can probably shorten it now.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:26.410
Finished already?

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:28.080
That was quick.

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:30.170
What are you looking at me for?

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:34.010
Looks like it'll be pretty chilly on the way home too.

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:36.670
The weather makes you want to have hot pot, doesn't it?

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:38.510
That'd be great.

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:39.590
Like oden, for example.

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:40.890
Or boiled tofu!

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:43.010
Or sukiyaki!

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:44.180
That settles it!

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:47.190
Let's have a surprise hot pot sometime!

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:49.770
<i>That's</i> what you go with?

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:55.320
I think this needs to be a little milder.

00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:57.530
Oh well.

00:17:58.530 --> 00:18:01.530
I wasn't sure if I should break the greatest
of all surprise hot pot taboos...

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:03.450
Don't you dare put that in!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:06.200
It might be a surprise hot pot,

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:11.960
but let's limit the ingredients to stuff that'd actually taste good in there.

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:13.210
Yep!

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.960
Let's put them in right away!

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:16.210
switch

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:17.340
Whoa, dark!

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:20.340
I can't see a thing.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:23.850
Better be careful you put it in the right place.

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:27.560
You see, I messed up once in the past.

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:29.940
At a gathering much like this,
I tried to stick it in and—

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.310
Seal that anecdote away forever, please.

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:35.320
Thank you for the food!

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:38.990
Is this persimmon?

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:42.120
The chicken's delicious.

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:44.740
We only had leftovers,

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:46.950
so I kinda feel ashamed now.

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:48.710
What, like this?

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:51.460
Nah, that one's from the Shichijous.

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:54.670
Kotomi?

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:57.050
I <i>did</i> think you were being unusually quiet...

00:18:57.050 --> 00:19:00.340
So it's true that crabs shut people up.

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:03.340
I'm trying to act like the quiet, shy type.

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:06.470
You failed the moment you said you were trying to act like one.

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:10.230
What a big wiener.

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:17.150
Dejima-san,

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:19.990
you're dribbling.

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:24.370
That was a great choice of words in this situation.

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:25.780
Excuse me while I go change my underwear.

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:27.370
You're a lost cause!

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:29.370
Thanks for the food!

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:34.000
It's hot in here, so I'll take off a layer.

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:36.500
I took one off as well.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:40.130
I'm pretty sure Aria wore a dress here...

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:43.510
I'm stuffed!

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:46.760
If you sleep right after a meal,
you'll turn into a cow.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:48.640
As if.

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:50.770
If you sleep right after a meal,

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:53.900
the reflux of gastric contents will cause inflammation of the esophagus,

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.400
which may lead to cancer.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:29.620
Okay.

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:31.330
Shall we begin?

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:32.240
Begin what?

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:38.580
We're going to give surprise presents to everyone who's helped us over the past year.

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:42.380
Since you're a resident here, I figured I should let you know in advance.

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:44.550
Oh, okay.

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:47.380
Good luck.

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:49.470
Well, uh...

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:52.760
I can't stay this excited if I'm by myself.

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:01.110
This is strangely lewd.

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:02.820
Is it the boobs, after all?!

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:06.320
Well, you know, the grass is always greener on the other side.

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:10.110
I don't see any grass on Kotomi's lawn, though.

00:22:10.110 --> 00:22:11.320
You're going to wake her!

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:21.380
I couldn't help but check if she hung her Christmas stockings.

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:21.500
Anyone'd think she believes in Santa.

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:23.960
Anyone'd think she
believes in Santa...
Anyone'd think she believes in Santa.

00:22:26.130 --> 00:22:27.050
Huh?

00:22:27.050 --> 00:22:29.590
What's with that outfit, Shino-chan?

00:22:30.220 --> 00:22:32.430
You must have the wrong person.

00:22:32.430 --> 00:22:33.810
I'm just Santa's daughter.

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:36.390
But Santa's a foreigner, you know.

00:22:37.180 --> 00:22:38.560
I'm an illegitimate child.

00:22:38.560 --> 00:22:39.850
What's this, an afternoon soap?!

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:43.770
Are you the type that can't fall asleep when using a different pillow?

00:22:43.770 --> 00:22:44.980
I guess.

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:48.280
Plus, I normally use a hug pillow.

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:49.240
Oh?

00:22:49.650 --> 00:22:53.030
As Santa, I'd like to help you out somehow.

00:22:55.830 --> 00:22:58.790
Doesn't Hagimura seem like
she'd be comfy to hug?

00:22:58.790 --> 00:22:59.710
Oh!

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:02.420
Suzu-chan.

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:04.000
Suzu-chan!

00:23:10.470 --> 00:23:11.380
Let me have you!

00:23:14.100 --> 00:23:15.010
Wait.

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:17.310
Don't get the wrong idea, Hagimura.

00:23:17.310 --> 00:23:19.310
Aria just wants to sleep with you.

00:23:20.940 --> 00:23:22.560
Igarashi Kaede here.

00:23:22.560 --> 00:23:25.770
Ever since the school turned co-ed,
discipline has grown more and more lax.

00:23:25.770 --> 00:23:27.070
It gives me a constant headache.

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:28.280
You can say that again.

00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:29.530
N-Next episode,

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:32.950
w-we'll mainly be covering chapter 119 in volume 5!

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:34.280
Hey, where are you going?!

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:35.950
Look out!
